   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Mindful of global uncertainties, we anticipate that revenue for the full year will be between £655m and £675m, and adjusted profit before tax will be between £155m and £170m.",
